# The `hep-font` package

Latin modern extended by computer modern.

## Introduction

The `hep-font` package sets up text fonts for the HEP package suite. It
selects the document font size, switches between serif and sans-serif
documents, chooses lining or oldstyle numerals, loads the appropriate
encodings and micro-typographic support, and extends the Latin Modern
setup with Computer Modern small caps and sans-serif upright italic shapes
where needed.

The package is loaded with `\usepackage{hep-font}`.

